```console
$ useful project show --help
Show a project

Usage: useful project show [OPTIONS] [PROJECT]

Arguments:
  [PROJECT]  Project ID or exact name

Options:
      --org <ORG>              Organization ID or exact slug to act in (default: USEFUL_ORG, then the project of this checkout, then your only organization)
      --project <PROJECT>      Project ID or exact name to act in (default: USEFUL_PROJECT, then the project of this checkout)
      --json                   Print the project result as JSON
      --api-key-file <PATH|->  Authenticate with a service API key from a private file, or - for standard input
      --allow-insecure-http    Allow this command's Useful Machinery requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                   Print help

```
